---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-27 - Record and Finalize Case Note
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADV as Advisor
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as CaseNotesController
    participant S as CaseNoteService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    ADV->>W: Write note on own case
    W->>C: POST /api/CaseNotes {caseId, noteText}
    C->>S: CreateAsync(CreatorId, request)
    S->>R: Caller is the case's advisor, case not closed
    S->>R: CreateAsync(note, isFinalized = false)
    R->>DB: INSERT CASENOTES
    ADV->>W: Edit the draft
    W->>C: PUT /api/CaseNotes/{id} {noteText}
    C->>S: UpdateAsync(AuthorId, CaseNoteId, request)
    S->>R: Own draft only (finalized -> 409), set editedAt, SaveAsync()
    ADV->>W: Finalize
    W->>C: PUT /api/CaseNotes/{id}/finalize
    C->>S: FinalizeAsync(AuthorId, CaseNoteId)
    S->>R: PrepareUpdate isFinalized = true, SaveAsync()
    R->>DB: UPDATE CASENOTES
    S->>S: Log activity caseNoteFinalized
    C-->>W: 200 OK
